From 0dee1e124ac081a71f26d7b994d7b4ea8f6b1141 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: austin62jake <340374338+austin62jake@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 08:18:13 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): a refused post keeps its reason in a window past the
 status line

The status line is shared: the next viewport click, pick or command
wrote over a post refusal before the user could act on it (#265). The
refusal now also lives in State::post_refusal and a 'Post refused'
window shows it until the user closes it, a later post succeeds, or the
document is switched. An edit keeps the window and notes that the
document has changed since.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
